{"spread": 32, "blocks": [[{"t": "Confronting the ghosts in the ", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 14.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 58, 249, 77]}, {"t": "walls", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 14.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 72, 95, 91]}], [{"t": "Perhaps the most hidden challenge is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 100, 246, 114]}, {"t": "also the most serious. As commercial ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 112, 243, 126]}, {"t": "director Jaymee Recto notes:", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 124, 205, 138]}], [{"t": "Most forget that ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 153, 210, 176]}, {"t": "these buildings date ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 172, 240, 195]}, {"t": "pre-war and with all ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 192, 234, 215]}, {"t": "the modernisation ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 211, 223, 234]}, {"t": "people forget ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 231, 187, 253]}, {"t": "asbestos is present ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 250, 232, 273]}, {"t": "in these kind of ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 269, 201, 292]}, {"t": "buildings.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-SemiBold", "size": 16.2, "color": "#231F20", "bbox": [75, 289, 152, 312]}], [{"t": "Asbestos was common in Singapore ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 367, 238, 381]}, {"t": "up to the late 1980s, so many pre-", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 379, 227, 393]}, {"t": "1991 buildings still contain it in roofs, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 391, 242, 405]}, {"t": "ceilings, and insulation. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [62, 403, 177, 417]}], [{"t": "Regulations require surveys and, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 210, 435, 223]}, {"t": "where present, removal by licensed ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 222, 448, 235]}, {"t": "specialists under strict protocols. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 234, 440, 247]}], [{"t": "For Mint, this is not a box to tick but a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 258, 461, 271]}, {"t": "responsibility to workers, neighbours, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 270, 459, 283]}, {"t": "and future occupants. Safe sites are ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 282, 454, 295]}, {"t": "the foundation on which conservation ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 294, 463, 307]}, {"t": "succeeds.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 306, 324, 319]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 318, 278, 331]}, {"t": "Heritage projects are demanding yet ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 330, 455, 343]}, {"t": "deeply rewarding. \u201cIt\u2019s not just another ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 342, 466, 355]}, {"t": "office floor or plant room we\u2019re fitting ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 354, 458, 367]}, {"t": "out,\u201d says managing director Mark ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 366, 443, 379]}, {"t": "Donlon. \u201cIt\u2019s living history.\u201d ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 378, 407, 391]}], [{"t": "Each successful retrofit extends the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 402, 455, 415]}, {"t": "life of a building without altering its ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 414, 451, 427]}, {"t": "soul.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [275, 426, 298, 439]}]]}